"Lucien is a leader of the Order of the Night King."
"He wants to overthrow the meritocracy and restore rule by noble blood."
"He calls corruption just the efficient way to reach the Order's goal."
"He reads minds by a hand on the forehead; he tore open Liora's memories."
"He knows Liora is a reborn human of Earth, and covets Earth's knowledge and machines."
"He offered Liora jewels, glimmerstones and evolutions to join the Order; she refused."
"He kills his own subordinates when it suits him."
"He ordered all of the Nine mobilized to hunt Renir, the one who could stop them."
"He ran the island lab that corrupted the southern seas until Cee and Renir sank it."
"He was last seen in the sinking lab, fighting corrupted beasts after a tunnel fell."
"Where he is now is unknown; he is surely alive, and hunting Liora and Renir."
